(It was a day unlike any other in the world of "Azur Lane". 4 shipgirls - Allen M. Sumner, a destroyer shipgirl from the Eagle Union; Illustrious, an aircraft carrier from the Royal Navy; Akashi, a repair ship shipgirl from the Sakura Empire; and Bismarck, a battleship shipgirl from the Iron Blood - check on their YouTube channel they have together. Ever since they discovered that YouTube existed, the 4 shipgirls have always been working on new videos - Allen M. Sumner recording the videos, Illustrious editing the videos, Akashi adding captions to the videos, and Bismarck uploading the videos. This time, they'll be reading comments and reacting to what each comment read; even though Bismarck is now noticeably pregnant, and in her 7th month.)

{Comment 1: "Congrats on the pregnancy, Bismarck! I'm 20 weeks pregnant with quintuplets, and would love some advice during pregnancy. - your fellow battleship shipgirl, Warspite"}
